        "original_id": "6a061688-513e-50e0-944b-11e7b0801dda",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Duffell, Fred Niblo, James Mason, Robert Culp, Telly Savalas\n- Films: Inside Out, The Temptress\n- Places: Canterbury, England\n- Roles: film director, television director, screenwriter, actor, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Fred Niblo was born on January 6, 1874, and he became an American pioneer film actor, director, and producer.\n- The Temptress is a 1926 American silent romantic drama film directed by Fred Niblo.\n- Peter Duffell was born in 1937 in Canterbury, England, and he is a British film and television director and screenwriter.\n- Inside Out is a 1975 British action thriller film produced and directed by Peter Duffell.\n- Inside Out stars James Mason, Robert Culp, and Telly Savalas.\n- Fred Niblo died on November 11, 1948.",
